       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL-SAMPLE.
       AUTHOR. ESTEIRA-MODEL-COB.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-EMPLOYEE-NAME       PIC X(30).
       01  WS-HOURS-WORKED        PIC 9(3)V9(2).
       01  WS-HOURLY-RATE         PIC 9(3)V9(2).
       01  WS-GROSS-PAY           PIC 9(5)V9(2).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARAGRAPH.
           PERFORM READ-TIMECARD
           PERFORM CALCULATE-PAY
           PERFORM PRINT-PAYSLIP
           STOP RUN.

       READ-TIMECARD.
           MOVE "SAMPLE EMPLOYEE" TO WS-EMPLOYEE-NAME
           MOVE 40.00 TO WS-HOURS-WORKED
           MOVE 25.00 TO WS-HOURLY-RATE.

       CALCULATE-PAY.
           COMPUTE WS-GROSS-PAY = WS-HOURS-WORKED * WS-HOURLY-RATE.

       PRINT-PAYSLIP.
           DISPLAY "EMPLOYEE: " WS-EMPLOYEE-NAME
           DISPLAY "GROSS PAY: " WS-GROSS-PAY.
